<title>UK: Deutsche sets warrants on Gold and Silver.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets warrants on Gold and Silver.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Bank AG has issued American-style call and put warrants of 500,000 per series on Gold and Silver, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p>The warrants all mature between March 27, 1998 and June 28, 2000. The payment date is July 21, 1997 and they are available in minimum exercise lots of 100.</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
